    qty: 40
  offerLine: One dish at a time isn't a cafe, it's a stunt. I want to walk in and have to choose. Three dishes on that board, all at once, for a whole day.
  activeLine: Three dishes up on the board at once. The board can hold more if you pay for it. And then see the day out.
  readyLine: Now I'm walking in and having to choose. Do you know how long it's been since anyone made me choose anything?
  doneLine: Come and see me tomorrow. I've been thinking about something.
